asr-000178-split-2
00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:52.820
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yes po, Mr.

asr-000179
00:13:52.820 --> 00:13:54.980
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: In fact po, Mr. Chair, yung pong nilagay

asr-000180
00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:56.560
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: na provision, welcome na welcome po,

asr-000181
00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:58.880
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: nagpapasalamat po kami doon sa provision na yun,

asr-000182
00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:01.120
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ng batas, kasi po at least

asr-000183
00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:02.900
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: although we have that authority to

asr-000184
00:14:02.900 --> 00:14:04.820
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: realign, at least in order to

asr-000185
00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:07.000
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ensure transparency, maliwanag po

asr-000186
00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:08.360
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: na kung sakali pong

asr-000187
00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:10.920
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ganap na ito na mapatupad

asr-000188
00:14:10.920 --> 00:14:13.100
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: yung batas na to, yung pong 11 billion

asr-000189
00:14:13.100 --> 00:14:14.880
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: more or less, yung po kasi yung

asr-000190
00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:16.860
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: aming papakiusap mamaya, tinanggalan po

asr-000191
00:14:16.860 --> 00:14:18.920
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: kasi kami, Mr. Chair, ng 15

asr-000192
00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:20.800
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: billion plus 723

asr-000193
00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:22.500
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: billion po, ang natanggal

asr-000194
00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:24.840
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: kay Comelec. So, at least po

asr-000195
00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:26.740
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: yung 11 billion more or less can be used by

asr-000196
00:14:26.740 --> 00:14:28.700
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Comelec in order to

asr-000197
00:14:28.700 --> 00:14:30.720
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ensure that the election of

asr-000198
00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:32.500
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: 2028 will not be compromised.

asr-000199
00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:34.920
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ano pa ang pakikinabangan doon sa

asr-000200
00:14:34.920 --> 00:14:36.800
Senator Panfilo Lacson: ano pa pwedeng pakinabangan

asr-000201
00:14:36.800 --> 00:14:38.380
Senator Panfilo Lacson: doon sa 8 billion na naggasta na?

asr-000202
00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:40.980
Senator Panfilo Lacson: O naka-locate na?

asr-000203
00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:42.720
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Mr. Chair,

asr-000204
00:14:42.800 --> 00:14:44.800
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: in all fairness po, nangyari na po

asr-000205
00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:46.640
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: sa atin dati nung nag-reset tayo ng Barangay

asr-000206
00:14:46.640 --> 00:14:48.800
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: and SK, yung mga balota po, 71

asr-000207
00:14:48.800 --> 00:14:50.900
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: million po lahat yun for the regular voters.

asr-000208
00:14:51.040 --> 00:14:52.640
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: 71 million na po kasi ang

asr-000209
00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:54.720
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: votante natin. Yung pong balota para sa SK,

asr-000210
00:14:55.100 --> 00:14:56.820
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: 25 million.

asr-000211
00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:58.660
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: In all fairness naman po,

asr-000212
00:14:58.700 --> 00:15:00.000
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: at yung putal

asr-000213
00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:03.700
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: talaga ay magagamit naman sa isang reset na barangay ng SK election.

asr-000214
00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:10.720
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: The Comelec End Bank will just issue a resolution saying na although November 2, 2026 ang nakaprint doon,

asr-000215
00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:12.500
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: pwede pa po namin gamitin lahat yun.

asr-000216
00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:19.580
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung po lahat ng mga gamit na na-procure na Comelec, pwede po natin magamit lang basta po ma-safekeep, ma-warehouse, nang maayos.

asr-000217
00:15:19.900 --> 00:15:25.220
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung po na-hire namin na mahigit 1,000 na casual employees at yung mga overtime,

asr-000218
00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:29.800
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: yun naman po ay na-hire at nag-overtime kami to ensure na meron tayong gamit

asr-000219
00:15:29.800 --> 00:15:32.020
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: at meron tayong na-imprintan ng mga kagamitan.

asr-000220
00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:36.820
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So, in all fairness po, doon sa baka may mamawala, masayang, wala naman po.

asr-000221
00:15:36.820 --> 00:15:41.220
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: But of course, when we reset an election, katulad ang ginagawa po natin lagi,

asr-000222
00:15:41.900 --> 00:15:48.680
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: we are going to reopen once again the registration of voters by second week of November this year po.

asr-000223
00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:51.780
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: And it will last until June 30 next year.

asr-000224
00:15:52.220 --> 00:15:54.560
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: We are projecting additional 3 million voters.

asr-000225
00:15:55.020 --> 00:15:59.740
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kung sakasakali po, pagdating po ng 2028, meron po tayong 74 million.

asr-000226
00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:05.180
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Pagdating po ng Barangay NSK election na second week of November of 2028,

asr-000227
00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:11.240
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: sabihin na po natin may dagdag na 1 million kasi meron po magkikinsi-anyos na mga votante, na mga SK.

asr-000228
00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:14.200
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So, magkikinsi-anyos po sila, dagdag po sila doon.

asr-000229
00:16:14.560 --> 00:16:17.800
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At yung mga nagkikinsi naman ngayon, pwede po maging 18 later.

asr-000230
00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:20.260
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So, madadagdag po sa atin.

asr-000231
00:16:20.900 --> 00:16:25.800
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Pag po nag-reset tayo ng Barangay NSK, lagi pong hihingi kami ng dagdag na budget.

asr-000232
00:16:26.780 --> 00:16:29.780
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kasi po, dagdag na votante, dagdag na president.

asr-000233
00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:33.700
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Dagdag na electoral board members, dagdag na election para Pernalia.

asr-000234
00:16:36.480 --> 00:16:37.580
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Maraming salamat po.

asr-000235
00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:44.660
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ang masasayang lang, yung talagang tapon, ito yung manpower utilization, di ba?

asr-000236
00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:46.640
Senator Panfilo Lacson: In terms of, for the preparation.

asr-000237
00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:47.900
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yes po, Mr. Chair.

asr-000238
00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:49.940
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Like overtime pay, etc.

asr-000239
00:16:50.600 --> 00:16:55.360
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yes po, pero yun po naman, yun naman po, Mr. Chair, ay nagamit namin yung mga overtime

asr-000240
00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:59.780
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: para lang po masigurado namin na piprint namin na maayos yung mga balot.

asr-000241
00:16:59.800 --> 00:17:04.600
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Masisigurado pong nakahanda lahat yung mga presinto natin, yung mga polling place natin.

asr-000242
00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:07.660
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So, technically, hindi naman po, wala po, Mr. Chair.

asr-000243
00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:10.380
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Thank you. So, let's listen to your presentation.

asr-000244
00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:11.600
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Chair.

asr-000245
00:17:11.600 --> 00:17:14.420
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yun na yung question and answer. Pagkatapos ng presentation, submitted na.

asr-000246
00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:16.860
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Chair, your honors.

asr-000247
00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:17.760
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Go ahead, please.

asr-000248
00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:19.180
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kung inyo pong mamarapatin.

asr-000249
00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:19.600
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yes.

asr-000250
00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:28.980
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Chair.

asr-000251
00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:32.700
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: With your kind permission, nabigyan lang po ako ng konting maiksing-maiksing,

asr-000252
00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:37.100
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: munting accomplishment po ng inyong commission election nitong nakaraang 2025.

asr-000253
00:17:37.260 --> 00:17:41.400
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ang aming pong budget utilization for 2025 ay 97%.

asr-000254
00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:46.460
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Sapagkat ang 2025 po ay national and local election, midterm elections po yan.

asr-000255
00:17:46.560 --> 00:17:50.080
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So, halos talaga pong nagamit namin ang lahat ng ating pong budget.

asr-000256
00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:56.040
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At dito po inalaan talaga, hindi lamang sa commission, kung hindi po yung pagkukondak natin,

asr-000257
00:17:56.040 --> 00:17:56.920
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ng halala.

asr-000258
00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:58.960
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ang 2025 po ay napakataas.

asr-000259
00:17:58.980 --> 00:18:00.980
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ang voters turn out, 82.2%.

asr-000260
00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:07.320
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Pinakamataas po yan sa kasaysayan ng midterm election sa ating midterm election.

asr-000261
00:18:07.760 --> 00:18:15.420
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At dito pong 2025 din, ang inyong Comelec ay nahalal bilang chairperson ng Association of World Electoral Bodies.

asr-000262
00:18:16.060 --> 00:18:19.220
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At the same time, Association of Asian Electoral Authorities.

asr-000263
00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:25.300
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Both at the same time, first time po na nangyari yan sa kasaysayan ng inyong dalawang electoral bodies.

asr-000264
00:18:25.300 --> 00:18:27.380
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Of course, madami po kami naisagawa.

asr-000265
00:18:27.380 --> 00:18:37.220
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Maliban sa national and local elections, na pinakamabilis po noong 2025 sapagkat nakapagproklamo po kami ng mayor sa gabi ng araw na eleksyon noong May 14.

asr-000266
00:18:37.620 --> 00:18:42.040
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kinabukasan, nakapagproklamo po kami ng mga congressmen at gobernador.

asr-000267
00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:44.600
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung pong mga senador na proklamo namin in five days.

asr-000268
00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:47.060
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At yung party list na proklamo po namin in seven days.

asr-000269
00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:49.920
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: The fastest in the history of Philippine election.

asr-000270
00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:56.720
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ngayon po, recently po, ang aming kahit paanong munting accomplishment, ay yung pong Bangsamoro parliamentary election.

asr-000271
00:18:56.720 --> 00:18:57.340
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kauna-una.

asr-000272
00:18:57.380 --> 00:18:58.660
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Sa ating kasaysayan.

asr-000273
00:18:59.040 --> 00:19:04.880
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Magbaga mat hindi po perfecto, ito po yung nagkaroon ng 84.34% voters turnout.

asr-000274
00:19:05.380 --> 00:19:05.900
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Highest.

asr-000275
00:19:06.300 --> 00:19:10.820
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: 84.34% po highest in the history of our country's election.

asr-000276
00:19:12.680 --> 00:19:15.440
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Madami pong talagang bumoto ng mga kababayan natin.

asr-000277
00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:22.840
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At mukha naman po accepted, acceptable sa lahat ng mga majority party, minority party at iba pang mga partido politikal.

asr-000278
00:19:22.840 --> 00:19:26.320
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Sa pagkat highly contested, napakaliit lang po ng lamangan.

asr-000279
00:19:26.320 --> 00:19:32.980
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung isa nakakuha ng 16 seats, yung isa nakakuha ng 15 seats, yung isa nakakuha ng 8 seats, at yung isa nakakuha ng 1 seat.

asr-000280
00:19:33.300 --> 00:19:42.280
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Subalit yung pong mga sectoral organizations, kahit po yung mga parliamentary districts, ay wala naman po mga narinig kami mga conference din.

asr-000281
00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:45.620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: We were able to proclaim the 80 seats all in all.

asr-000282
00:19:46.360 --> 00:19:47.300
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: The next day lang po.

asr-000283
00:19:47.900 --> 00:19:56.300
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Bago po inabot ng gabi, na proklamo na po kaagad namin yung ating mga nanalo na mga parliamentary districts.

asr-000284
00:19:56.320 --> 00:19:58.620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Members ng Bangsamoro.

asr-000285
00:19:59.060 --> 00:20:04.980
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So, yan po at the same time ang Inyapong Commission on Election was awarded the Commission of the Year.

asr-000286
00:20:06.120 --> 00:20:08.400
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: International award po yung aming tinanggap na yun.

asr-000287
00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:16.620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Plus all four other awards given by the international body, ICPS, to the Commission on Election.

asr-000288
00:20:16.780 --> 00:20:19.820
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So kahit paano po, ay malaking accomplishments sa amin.

asr-000289
00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:25.780
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Including the three consecutive for the first time in the 85-year history of the Comelec.

asr-000290
00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:32.540
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kami po yung nakakuha ng tatlong magkakasunod na unqualified opinion from the Commission on Audit.

asr-000291
00:20:32.640 --> 00:20:40.860
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So, yun naman po ay kahit paano, yung pananalapi, mapagmamalaki namin na inaayos po namin upang kahit paano,

asr-000292
00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:47.360
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: may pagtitiwala ang tao at masigurado ang proper accountability and transparency.

asr-000293
00:20:47.360 --> 00:20:54.180
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kaya lang po, Mr. Chair, kami po yung nag-propose dahil naghahanda po kami ng halalang para sa 2028.

asr-000294
00:20:54.660 --> 00:20:55.580
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Nag-propose po kami.

asr-000295
00:20:55.580 --> 00:20:58.520
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Na sana makakapag-print na kami ng balota next year.

asr-000296
00:20:58.820 --> 00:21:01.280
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Sana makapag-procure na kami ng machine by next year.

asr-000297
00:21:01.640 --> 00:21:08.840
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Hindi po po pwedeng 2028 ang pag-print ng balota, pag-procure ng machines, at lahat po ng mga gagawin ay hindi pwedeng 2028.

asr-000298
00:21:09.220 --> 00:21:12.980
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Dapat po lahat siyan, sa karanasan natin, ay a year before the election.

asr-000299
00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:15.860
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ang problem po ay nabawasan po kami, Mr. Chair.

asr-000300
00:21:16.260 --> 00:21:19.240
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Mr. Chair, if I may lang po. May tanong lang ako, isang question lang.

asr-000301
00:21:21.540 --> 00:21:25.500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Napapansin ko, tumataas na yung trajectory ng mga voters' turnout.

asr-000302
00:21:25.580 --> 00:21:35.080
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: From 2016, am I correct? 2019, 2022, 2025, until sa BARM election, yung pataas siya, no?

asr-000303
00:21:35.220 --> 00:21:35.600
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yes po.

asr-000304
00:21:35.880 --> 00:21:40.520
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ibig sabihin, nagpa-participate na po ang mga kababayan natin, mga voters, tumataas na.

asr-000305
00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:49.560
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Tama po kayo, Mr. Chair. In fact, ang kabataan ng 2025, 45% ng mga kabataan ang bumoto po ng 2025 National and Local Elections.

asr-000306
00:21:49.560 --> 00:21:55.000
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At kita niyo po, kahit po barangay ng SK Elections, mataas din po ang voters' turnout.

asr-000307
00:21:55.580 --> 00:22:04.360
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Sa dito pong Bangsamoro, after more or less three postponements, nakapagtataka at nakakatuwa po, 84.34%.

asr-000308
00:22:04.360 --> 00:22:11.560
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Maalala ko before, about 70% up lang po. Ngayon, umabot na ng 82%, umabot na ng 84% nung BARM elections.

asr-000309
00:22:11.700 --> 00:22:17.860
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ibig sabihin, nagpa-participate na po ang mga ating mga kababayan. Sana, tumaas pa lalo ito to 90%.

asr-000310
00:22:17.860 --> 00:22:21.800
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Sana po. Ang isa pong dahilan talaga din po dyan is automation of the election.

asr-000311
00:22:22.440 --> 00:22:25.340
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: And at the same time, siguro po yung malawakang voters'

asr-000312
00:22:25.580 --> 00:22:29.580
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: education campaign. At tulong na rin po ng iba't ibang civil society organizations.

asr-000313
00:22:29.800 --> 00:22:33.000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Meron lang akong gustong i-suggest rin po sa inyo. Pakicheck nyo lang po.

asr-000314
00:22:33.500 --> 00:22:38.000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Napansin ko, kahit na 82% yung voters' turnout sa national natin,

asr-000315
00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:48.640
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: but sa mga overseas Filipino na voters natin, less than 50% po yung turnout.

asr-000316
00:22:48.840 --> 00:22:55.240
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So, maaaring tingnan nyo na hindi na sila mahirapan or na bumoto or mainganyo silang,

asr-000317
00:22:55.580 --> 00:23:04.080
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: bumoto, maaaring malayo o nahirapan sila, baka maka ano kayo, makagawa kayo ng bagong sistema

asr-000318
00:23:04.080 --> 00:23:07.220
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: na mas maging convenient para sa mga overseas Filipino.

asr-000319
00:23:07.220 --> 00:23:12.660
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Chair. Kami po ay nagsagawa na sa kauna-unang pagkakataon in our history

asr-000320
00:23:12.660 --> 00:23:16.480
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ng ating tinatawag na internet voting nito pong 2025.

asr-000321
00:23:16.640 --> 00:23:24.580
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Maaaring po kasing bago at syempre po medyo sinasalat pa ng mga kababayan natin kung paano talaga ito tinitingnan.

asr-000322
00:23:25.580 --> 00:23:30.160
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Hindi po ganun kataas. Sa isang midterm elections po, Mr. Chair, lagi po siyang mababa.

asr-000323
00:23:30.160 --> 00:23:38.460
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Hindi pa po siya tumaas ng 20%. Noong nakaraang 2020, kahit po noong 2022, inabot lang po ng 18.3%.

asr-000324
00:23:38.460 --> 00:23:44.100
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ito pong 2025, 18.2%. Pero po pagka presidential election, tumataas po siya, Mr. Chair.

asr-000325
00:23:44.420 --> 00:23:49.160
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Noong 2022 po, presidential election, inabot po siya ng 40.59%.

asr-000326
00:23:49.920 --> 00:23:51.500
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So, less than 50% pa rin po.

asr-000327
00:23:51.500 --> 00:23:52.480
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yes po, Mr. Chair.

asr-000328
00:23:52.680 --> 00:23:55.540
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Para naman mabigyan sila ng pagkakataon.

asr-000329
00:23:55.580 --> 00:23:58.340
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Yung mga OFWs natin, gustong-gustong bumoto noon.

asr-000330
00:23:58.460 --> 00:24:06.760
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Kaya lang siguro, maaaring yung oras nila o yung saan sila pupunta o hindi nila alam na meron na tayong online voting.

asr-000331
00:24:06.940 --> 00:24:10.320
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Baka yung formation campaign nyo po, mas mapaigting pa po.

asr-000332
00:24:10.880 --> 00:24:11.520
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Salamat po.

asr-000333
00:24:11.840 --> 00:24:13.020
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Chair.

asr-000334
00:24:13.980 --> 00:24:19.200
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So, kami po, Mr. Chair, ay nabawasan ng 7 billion yung una.

asr-000335
00:24:19.600 --> 00:24:23.220
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Tinanggal po namin, zero po kami sa budget para sa aming pinapagawang building.

asr-000336
00:24:23.720 --> 00:24:25.560
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Zero po kami sa budget para sa mga local.

asr-000337
00:24:25.580 --> 00:24:30.840
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Zero po kami sa mga field-integrated offices po namin.

asr-000338
00:24:31.280 --> 00:24:33.400
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Originally po, 7 billion ang tinanggal sa amin.

asr-000339
00:24:33.540 --> 00:24:38.200
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Pero pagdating po ng NEP, nadagdagan po ito ng 15 point something billion.

asr-000340
00:24:38.340 --> 00:24:41.580
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So, more or less po, 22, 23 billion ang nawala po sa amin.

asr-000341
00:24:42.040 --> 00:24:45.400
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ang problema po namin, doon po sa 15 billion na nawala sa amin,

asr-000342
00:24:46.040 --> 00:24:48.820
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: okay na po yung tinanggal lang kami sa regular agency budget.

asr-000343
00:24:49.380 --> 00:24:50.760
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Pwede po kami magtipid ng lahat.

asr-000344
00:24:50.760 --> 00:24:55.560
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Pero we cannot compromise, Mr. Chair, yung automated election natin ng 2028.

asr-000345
00:24:55.580 --> 00:24:58.080
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Tinanggal po sa amin, Mr. Chair.

asr-000346
00:24:58.560 --> 00:25:04.520
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: For example, tayo po ay magkakailanganin po natin more or less 24,000 machines.

asr-000347
00:25:06.640 --> 00:25:10.020
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: 124,000 machines para sa 2028 elections.

asr-000348
00:25:10.740 --> 00:25:14.120
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kung kaya lang po, natanggalan po kami more or less ng 1.6 billion.

asr-000349
00:25:14.720 --> 00:25:18.220
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Question, if you know, how much has the House restored?

asr-000350
00:25:19.000 --> 00:25:24.320
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kasi we have not received the GAB, the General [unclear] Bill, yung house version.

asr-000351
00:25:24.320 --> 00:25:27.320
Senator Panfilo Lacson: And if you know, nag-restore ba sila sa...

asr-000352
00:25:27.860 --> 00:25:28.980
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Wala po, Mr. Chair.

asr-000353
00:25:29.700 --> 00:25:38.400
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: During the budget deliberation po, nakiusap na lang ako sa, kami po sa committee on appropriation, subcommittee on appropriation,

asr-000354
00:25:38.920 --> 00:25:40.080
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: na kung pe pwede.

asr-000355
00:25:40.840 --> 00:25:48.620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kung yung pong, kasi alam po namin, Mr. Chair, yung 16% na napakaliit na space, budget space po natin,

asr-000356
00:25:49.120 --> 00:25:53.580
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: mukhang wala naman po kami pagkukuhanan kung saan pa natin kukuhanan yung departamento.

asr-000357
00:25:53.580 --> 00:25:58.620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ang sabi na lang po namin, kung sakali pong hindi matutuloy ang barangay ng SK elections,

asr-000358
00:25:59.140 --> 00:26:06.780
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: baka pa pwede pong yung 10.9 billion na unexpended balance, gamitin na lang po namin, ilagay na lang po,

asr-000359
00:26:07.120 --> 00:26:10.320
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: at kaya po nakakatuwa doon sa BSKE po na ilagay.

asr-000360
00:26:10.820 --> 00:26:17.840
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Pero ang Congress din po, sa kanila pong special provision, ilalagay din daw po yung provision na yan

asr-000361
00:26:17.840 --> 00:26:21.260
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: para daw po makasigurado na may magagamit si Comelec.

asr-000362
00:26:23.580 --> 00:26:28.080
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Understood. So you're hoping na ma-postpone?

asr-000363
00:26:28.380 --> 00:26:35.820
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yes po, kaya po, Mr. Chair. Kami naman po, naandito kami, hindi po para pabigatin ang problema pa ng committee

asr-000364
00:26:35.820 --> 00:26:42.520
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: kung saan po kukuhanin pa yung sa amin. Yung sa amin lang po is, sana po mailagay na lang din as a special provision

asr-000365
00:26:42.520 --> 00:26:46.320
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: yung pong nailagay sa barangay ng SK. Malaking tulong na po yun,

asr-000366
00:26:46.320 --> 00:26:52.040
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: because maibabalik po namin, Mr. Chair, yung 9 billion, 9.2 billion na nawala kay Comelec

asr-000367
00:26:52.040 --> 00:26:53.560
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: na pang national and local election.

asr-000368
00:26:53.580 --> 00:26:59.680
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung natitira pong kulang-kulang na 2 billion, yun na lang po yung gagamitin namin pang-hire ng casual employees,

asr-000369
00:27:00.100 --> 00:27:08.540
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: yung pong sa registration of voters namin, and such other activities na natanggal po sa regular agency budget.

asr-000370
00:27:08.960 --> 00:27:15.900
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ang importante po, okay na po yung 11 billion kesa po, kahit po nawala yung buong 15, at least po mayroon kami yung 11 billion.

asr-000371
00:27:17.280 --> 00:27:21.820
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kindly update, kasi yung binigay sa aking briefer, yung sa utilization rate,

asr-000372
00:27:21.820 --> 00:27:28.740
Senator Panfilo Lacson: well, it is true na 99.9 yung, as of December 31, yung aming data.

asr-000373
00:27:28.900 --> 00:27:32.340
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kung meron kayong as of June 30, 2026, kindly update us.

asr-000374
00:27:32.840 --> 00:27:33.460
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yes, po, Mr. Chair.

asr-000375
00:27:33.660 --> 00:27:39.280
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kasi yung sa, yung na-release talagang nasa 99.9%, no?

asr-000376
00:27:39.740 --> 00:27:45.780
Senator Panfilo Lacson: 47.334 billion ang na-release, na iwan lang 32 million eh.

asr-000377
00:27:46.280 --> 00:27:51.480
Senator Panfilo Lacson: But of the release amount, 26.4 billion or 55.9%

asr-000378
00:27:51.820 --> 00:27:53.800
Senator Panfilo Lacson: lang yung obligated.

asr-000379
00:27:54.900 --> 00:28:03.700
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Okay, so yung 20.861 billion, corresponding to 44.1%, yun ang remain unobligated.

asr-000380
00:28:04.520 --> 00:28:07.320
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Pero yung disbursement rate, again, mataas.

asr-000381
00:28:08.160 --> 00:28:08.440
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So,

asr-000382
00:28:09.580 --> 00:28:16.820
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So, Mr. Chair, sa kasalukuyan po, as of September 15, ang aming pong budget utilization ay 38.68%,

asr-000383
00:28:17.760 --> 00:28:21.780
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: sapagkat ito nga po yung sa barangay ng SK, yung part ng period po,

asr-000384
00:28:21.820 --> 00:28:25.700
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yeah, I know. Pero yung obligation, yung unobligated, nabawasan na?

asr-000385
00:28:26.240 --> 00:28:26.480
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yes.

asr-000386
00:28:27.040 --> 00:28:29.220
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Naka-factorin yung BSKE?

asr-000387
00:28:29.480 --> 00:28:30.140
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yes, po, Mr. Chair.

asr-000388
00:28:30.140 --> 00:28:31.680
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ah, okay. Thank you. Understood.

asr-000389
00:28:36.020 --> 00:28:38.820
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So, dito po ako para sumuporta sa inyo.

asr-000390
00:28:40.080 --> 00:28:46.380
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Anyway, I would like to congratulate the Comelec, led by Chairperson George Garcia,

asr-000391
00:28:46.380 --> 00:28:51.700
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: sa lahat po na empleyado, sa lahat ng commissioners, ng directors ng Comelec,

asr-000392
00:28:51.700 --> 00:28:57.020
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: for the successful conduct of the first ever Bangsamoro Parliamentary Elections.

asr-000393
00:28:57.560 --> 00:28:59.140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Congratulations po sa inyong lahat.

asr-000394
00:28:59.160 --> 00:29:04.080
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Anyway, we'll give you time to submit according to the order of priorities,

asr-000395
00:29:04.460 --> 00:29:08.640
Senator Panfilo Lacson: kung ano yung gusto nyong ipaugment.

asr-000396
00:29:08.740 --> 00:29:15.240
Senator Panfilo Lacson: And let's find out if we can create some fiscal space pagdating nung GAB sa amin.

asr-000397
00:29:15.240 --> 00:29:17.020
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yes, po, Mr. Chair. Maraming maraming salamat.

asr-000398
00:29:17.080 --> 00:29:20.240
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ano pa naman? November pa naman siguro yung plenary dito eh, so...

asr-000399
00:29:21.700 --> 00:29:24.720
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Okay. So, yeah.

asr-000400
00:29:25.260 --> 00:29:29.040
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: I move to approve the budget of the Commission on Elections.

asr-000401
00:29:29.320 --> 00:29:36.240
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: And I recommend pala to approve the budget and submit it to the plenary for consideration, po.

asr-000402
00:29:36.720 --> 00:29:40.900
Senator Panfilo Lacson: There's a motion to recommend to the plenary the budget of the Comelec.

asr-000403
00:29:41.520 --> 00:29:46.640
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So, hearing no objection, so submitted, approved. Thank you.

asr-000404
00:29:47.000 --> 00:29:51.140
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Chair. Senator Bong, maraming maraming salamat po.

asr-000406
00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:01.220
Senator Panfilo Lacson: [unclear] suspended.

